1270 0 obj
<<
/K 15
/Alt ($A_{t}$  from  policy  network  $\\pi _{\\theta}\(A_{t}|S_{t}\)$\\;         Step  the  environment,  observe  new  states  $S_{t+1}$,  and  dones  $d_{t}$\\; par        Store  experiences  $\(S_{t},  A_{t},  r,  S_{t+1},  d_{t}\)$  in  \\texttt{storage}\\; par        \\If{step  \\%  \\texttt{GCN\\_interval}  ==  0}{             \\textbf{Build  Transition  Graph  G}\\;                         \\For{each  transition  in  \\texttt{storage}}{                 Add  transition  $\(S_{t},  A_{t},  S_{t+1}\)$  to  $G$\\;             } par            Build  the  sampled  transition  matrix  $P'$  from  $G$\\;             Construct  Krylov  basis  $K$  from  $P'$\\;             Update  GCT  with  $K$\\; parpar        } parpar    }     Compute  returns  $r$  and  advantages  $\\hat{A}_{t}$\\; par        Compute  the  probability  ratio  $pr\(\\theta \)  =  \\frac{\\pi _{\\theta}\(A_{t}|S_{t}\)}{\\pi _{\\theta _{old}}\(A_{t}|S_{t}\)}$\\;         Compute  the  clipped  objective:         $$L^{CLIP}\(\\theta \)  =  \\mathbb{E}_{t}  [  \\min \(  pr\(\\theta \)  \\hat{A}_{t},  \\text{clip}\(pr\(\\theta \),  1  -  \\epsilon ,  1  +  \\epsilon \)  \\hat{A}_{t}\)]$$         Update  the  policy  parameters  by  maximizing  the  objective  function:         $$         \\theta \\leftarrow \\theta +  \\alpha \\nabla _{\\theta }L^{CLIP}\(\\theta \)$$         Compute  combined  value  function:         $$         Q_{\\text{comb}}  =  \\alpha Q  +  \(1  -  \\alpha \)  Q_{\\phi        }$$         Update  rewards  in  \\texttt{storage}  with  shaped  rewards\\;     \\If{episode  end}{         Log  rewards,  losses,  and  other  metrics\\;         Save  model  checkpoints\\;     } par    Reset  \\texttt{storage}  and  environment  for  new  episode\\; } \\textbf)
/S /MATH
/Pg 159 0 R
/ID (553)
/P 1269 0 R
/A 1271 0 R
>>
